WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:03.826
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> So, this happened some years ago.

2
00:00:04.105 --> 00:00:09.474
I was nineteen, and that summer I finished with my boyfriend.

3
00:00:09.951 --> 00:00:15.862
I wanted to travel as far away as possible, but I needed to get a job!

4
00:00:16.371 --> 00:00:25.517
I was lucky to find temporary work as a receptionist in California, so I booked my flights with a travel agent.

5
00:00:25.648 --> 00:00:36.929
I was really excited. A few weeks later, just five days before my flight, I checked all my travel documents.

6
00:00:37.225 --> 00:00:53.891
Suddenly I noticed a mistake. My surname on the flight booking was Leanna, L-e-a-n-n-a, not Leanne, L-e-a-n-n-e.

7
00:00:53.989 --> 00:01:05.828
Just one small typo, but a very big mistake, because of course the name on my passport was Leanne, and I was sure that was a problem.

8
00:01:06.091 --> 00:01:11.411
I immediately called the travel agent and asked them to change the name on the ticket.

9
00:01:11.477 --> 00:01:15.812
They weren’t stressed at all, and suggested a solution.

10
00:01:16.173 --> 00:01:21.904
‘Don’t worry. We can cancel your ticket and then book you a new one for the same flight.’

11
00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:26.173
It was expensive, but I decided to do it.

12
00:01:26.403 --> 00:01:35.959
When I arrived at the check-in desk, I showed my passport to the assistant, but my name wasn’t on the flight!

13
00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:43.660
I started to panic. I phoned the travel agent and they discovered it was their mistake.

14
00:01:43.858 --> 00:01:49.703
They talked to the woman at check-in. I waited… and I waited…

15
00:01:49.851 --> 00:01:55.007
Finally, she handed me my boarding pass. I was on the flight!

16
00:01:55.122 --> 00:02:00.376
She even arranged transport for me to get through security quickly, and to my gate.

17
00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:07.634
I was the last person to board the plane, but when I was in my seat I finally started to relax.

18
00:02:07.962 --> 00:02:12.133
At last, I was on the biggest adventure of my life!

19
00:02:12.445 --> 00:02:20.458
And the journey ended well – to my great surprise, when I arrived, my suitcase arrived with me!

20
00:02:20.557 --> 00:02:22.740
An absolute miracle!